xt":". See the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/FeatureGate","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"enum","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for available options."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, before displaying a component, you should call "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/EmbeddedCare\/checkFeatureGate(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" with the relevant feature gate to make sure the component should be displayed."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["if EmbeddedCare.shared.checkFeatureGate(.globalRollout) {","    \/\/ View logic to display `ComponentView`","}"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Deep Linking","anchor":"Deep-Linking","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK can handle certain deep-links to embedded care content through either urls or push notifications."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In your open-url and push notification handling code, call "},{"code":"EmbeddedCare\/handleURL(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/EmbeddedCare\/handleNotification(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" respectively to give the SDK an opportunity to respond to a deep-link event. Use "},{"code":"EmbeddedCare.shared.processStoredDeeplinks()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the UI is in a stable state, to ensure that the latest deep links are called."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Compatiblity","anchor":"Compatiblity","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK has minimum version requirements of Swift 5.5 and iO